Inyandiko bigeze: ['html'] kora: { <- (
		ubwacyo
		simbuza: ['&'] na: ['&amp;'],
		simbuza: ['<'] na: ['&lt;'],
		simbuza: ['>'] na: ['&gt;'],
		simbuza: ['"'] na: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Urutonde gishya.

['Verbatim Syntax'] inyuguti-zose buri: { :umubare :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (umubare), Letter: letter).
}.

Ibisohoka list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list huza: ['↵']).

Ibisohoka andika: template.

